    },
    {
     "at": "कि भारी",
     "text": "Heavy objects bend space and time..."
    },
    {
     "at": "और उस मुड़े",
     "text": "...and light travelling along that curve bends too"
    },
    {
     "at": "इसे कहते हैं",
